{"id":"ee7258e7e5d29f4499bb628a3d49fe4755cac6aa","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1234624","title":"ChatGPT Plus 本周地板价：菲律宾 ₱999，约 $16.3（土耳其已经不便宜了）","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"robin421","excerpt":"推广 - @robin421 - 本周对照了一下 App Store 区域价。ChatGPT Plus 地板还是菲律宾，₱999 ，折合约 $16.31 ，比美区 $19.99 低大约 18%。土耳其涨过之后已经不划算了。","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17977599\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/af5e/0385/651753_normal.png?m=1695968108\" alt=\"sleek7671\" data-uid=\"651753\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/sleek7671\">sleek7671</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-15 16:51:03 +08:00\">23h 15m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>听说菲律宾 web 购买 20x 便宜，可我怎么也付不了款，用的卡也是网上说可以支付的，不知道咋回事</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17977633\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6765ab7d9138a59113aed5d54588a069?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"robin421\" data-uid=\"85669\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/robin421\">robin421</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-15 17:06:58 +08:00\">22h 59m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>菲律宾这条是 App Store 区域标价（ Plus ₱999 ），不是 <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://chatgpt.com\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">chatgpt.com</a> 网页结账。Web 端经常还是美元，卡被拒很常见，Pro 20x 更明显。</p><p>App Store 路径一般是菲律宾 Apple ID + 当地礼品卡。国际卡能过的不多，IP 不一致也容易挂。帖子里那张表按店面标了风险。</p><p>只做对照，换不换自己看条款。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17977653\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a5cddf1cfbfa4a510fbc1aeeb2ecbb24?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"nero2021\" data-uid=\"558633\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/nero2021\">nero2021</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-15 17:17:52 +08:00\">22h 48m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>买质保一个月的 plus 成品号不也才四五十，一个月买一次不也可以嘛，和自己的号开 plus 订阅有啥区别</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17977689\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6765ab7d9138a59113aed5d54588a069?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"robin421\" data-uid=\"85669\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/robin421\">robin421</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-15 17:44:22 +08:00\">22h 22m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>@<a href=\"/member/nero2021\">nero2021</a> 成品号/共享号跟自己开订阅不是一回事。前者聊天记录和账号随时可能没，后者号是你的。本帖只对照官方区域标价，不推荐买号。</p><p>@<a href=\"/member/sleek7671\">sleek7671</a> Web 结账看的是账号地区加风控，不只是 IP 。改地区脚本、强制跳转都不稳，封号比省下来的钱贵。App Store 菲律宾价和 <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://chatgpt.com\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">chatgpt.com</a> 网页不是一条支付线。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17977699\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>